        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.316,
            0.832,
            0.826,
            0.848
          ],
          "content": "Fig. 7.1: Energy required to carry out tasks comes from various sources"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.252,
            0.857,
            0.89,
            0.91
          ],
          "content": "We often use the words work, energy, and power in everyday conversations. As we learnt in Chapter 1, these terms have a precise meaning in science. Let us first understand how to **define** work."
        },
